#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:1
msgid "HistoryPanel 操作和分析历史数据"
msgstr "Use HistoryPanel to operate on and analyze historical data"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:3
msgid ""
"在完成「入门」「获取并管理金融数据」，以及（建议阅读）[HistoryPanel 数据面板基础操作](2.4-historypanel-"
"basics.md) 之后，我们已经可以："
msgstr ""
"After completing \"Getting Started\", \"Acquiring and Managing Financial "
"Data\", and (recommended reading) [HistoryPanel Basic Operations of Data "
"Panel] (2.4-historypanel-basics.md), we can already:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:5
msgid "在本地配置好数据源并下载所需的历史数据；"
msgstr ""
"Configure the data source locally and download the required historical data;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:6
msgid "创建 `HistoryPanel`，并完成切片、扩列、对齐与 `DataFrame` 互转等容器级操作。"
msgstr ""
"Create `HistoryPanel` and complete container-level operations such as "
"slicing, column expansion, alignment, and mutual conversion of `DataFrame`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:8
msgid "本章将在此基础上，通过完整小例子演示如何用 `HistoryPanel` **玩数据**（因子、出图、组合粗验）："
msgstr ""
"On this basis, this chapter will demonstrate how to use `HistoryPanel` "
"**Playing with data** (factors, plots, combined rough tests) through a "
"complete small example:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:10
msgid ""
"**关于`HistoryPanel`**: "
"`HistoryPanel`类是`qteasy`提供的**因子研究与粗验**容器对象，它提供了一系列量化金融分析常用的数据分析工具，便于用户「玩数据」（进行数据分析、解析以及数据背后的关联挖掘），以及可视化图表，便于用户“目视筛因子”；"
msgstr ""
"**About `HistoryPanel`**: The `HistoryPanel` class is the **factor research "
"and rough test** container object provided by `qteasy`. It provides a series"
" of data analysis tools commonly used in quantitative financial analysis to "
"facilitate users to \"play with data\" (carry out data analysis, analysis "
"and correlation mining behind the data), as well as visual charts to "
"facilitate users to \"visually screen factors\";"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:12
msgid "`HistoryPanel`的功能包括："
msgstr "`HistoryPanel`’s features include:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:13
msgid "统一管理多标的、多指标的历史数据；"
msgstr ""
"Unified management of historical data for multiple instruments and multiple "
"indicators;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:14
msgid ""
"时序变换（``shift`` / ``diff`` / ``pct_change``）与缺失处理（``ffill`` / ``bfill`` / "
"``dropna``）；"
msgstr ""
"Timing transformation (``shift`` / ``diff`` / ``pct_change``）与缺失处理（``ffill``"
" / ``bfill`` / ``dropna``);"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:15
msgid "列表达式 ``expr`` 与 ``assign`` 派生因子列；"
msgstr "Column expression ``expr`` 与 ``assign`` derived factor column;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:16
msgid "统计聚合补齐（``sum`` / ``median`` / ``var`` / ``quantile``，与 ``mean`` 同契约）；"
msgstr ""
"Statistical aggregation completion (``sum`` / ``median`` / ``var`` / "
"``quantile``，与 ``mean`` same contract);"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:17
msgid "面板级时序相关 / 协方差矩阵（``corr`` / ``cov``）；"
msgstr ""
"Panel-level temporal correlation/covariance matrix (``corr`` / ``cov``);"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:18
msgid "计算收益率、波动率等简单因子；"
msgstr "Calculate simple factors such as returns and volatility;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:19
msgid "叠加 K 线技术指标；"
msgstr "Overlay K-line technical indicators;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:20
msgid "识别部分蜡烛形态；"
msgstr "Identify some candlestick patterns;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:21
msgid "使用 ``where`` 生成与数据同形的 **bool 掩码**，为后续带 ``mask=`` 的研究接口做准备；"
msgstr ""
"Use ``where`` to generate a **bool mask** with the same shape as the data, "
"in preparation for subsequent research APIs that take ``mask=``; "

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:22
msgid ""
"使用 **列属性**（如 ``hp.close``）、**比较运算**（返回 ``numpy`` 布尔数组，可与 ``where`` 衔接）以及 "
"**``hp.loc``**（仅沿时间轴筛选，等价 ``hp[:, :, key]``）。"
msgstr ""
"Use **column attributes** (e.g., ``hp.close``), **comparison operators** "
"(returning a ``numpy`` boolean array that can be chained with ``where``), "
"and **``hp.loc``** (filters only along the time axis, equivalent to ``hp[:, "
":, key]``)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:23
msgid "通过对数据的筛选实现简单的“回测”分析；"
msgstr "Implement simple \"backtest\" analysis by filtering data;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:25
msgid ""
"**注**：`HistoryPanel`并不支持**完整回测**功能（包含费用计算、交割、MOQ、信号类型控制以及详细交易报告等元素），完整的回测仍须交给"
" `qteasy` 提供的 `Operator` 对象和 `Backtester` 来实现，详见 [从 HistoryPanel 研究到 "
"Strategy / Operator](#从-historypanel-研究到-strategy--"
"operator迁移路径)。容器结构与基本切片若尚不熟悉，请先阅读 [HistoryPanel 数据面板基础操作](2.4-historypanel-"
"basics.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**: `HistoryPanel` does not support the **complete backtest** function"
" (including elements such as fee calculation, delivery, MOQ, signal type "
"control, and detailed transaction reports). The complete backtest must still"
" be implemented by the `Operator` objects and `Backtester` provided by "
"`qteasy`. For details, see [From HistoryPanel Research to Strategy / "
"Operator](#From-historypanel-research to-strategy--operator migration path)."
" If you are not familiar with container structure and basic slicing, please "
"read [HistoryPanelBasic Operations of Data Panel](2.4-historypanel-"
"basics.md) first."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:27
msgid ""
"更完整的 API 说明可参考 [HistoryPanel API 参考](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)（含「列属性访问、比较与 "
"``loc``」与 ``where`` 专节）。"
msgstr ""
"For a more complete API description, see the [HistoryPanel API "
"Reference](../api/HistoryPanel.rst) (including the dedicated sections on "
"“column attribute access, comparisons, and ``loc``” and on ``where``)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:32
msgid "数据检查——快速跑通最小闭环"
msgstr "Data inspection - quickly run through the minimum closed loop"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:34
msgid ""
"若您已经完成了 [获取并管理金融数据](2.0-get-data.md) 的学习，并下载了**最小数据集**，可按本节 checklist 跑通「取数 "
"→ 出图 → 简单因子 → 与基准粗对比」——建议您在深入阅读下文之前，先掌握这些基础用法。"
msgstr ""
"If you have completed the study of [Acquiring and managing financial data] "
"(2.0-get-data.md) and downloaded the **minimum data set**, you can follow "
"this section of the checklist to run through \"Getting numbers → Plotting → "
"Simple factors → Rough comparison with the benchmark\" - it is recommended "
"that you master these basic usages before reading in depth below."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:36
msgid ""
"**前置条件**：已配置好 `tushare_token`，且已下载 [最小数据集清单](2.0-get-data.md#最小数据集清单供-25-使用)"
" 中的表（至少含 `index_daily` 或 `stock_daily`）。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisite**: `tushare_token` has been configured, and the tables in "
"[Minimum Data Set List] (2.0-get-data.md#Minimum Data Set List for -25-use) "
"have been downloaded (containing at least `index_daily` or `stock_daily`)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:38
msgid "**本节目标**："
msgstr "**Goal of this section**:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:40
msgid "**数据获取**：用 `get_kline` 从数据源中拉取多只股票及指数的K线数据，并创建一个 `HistoryPanel` 对象"
msgstr ""
"**Data Acquisition**: Use `get_kline` to pull K-line data of multiple stocks"
" and indices from the data source, and create a `HistoryPanel` object"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:41
msgid "**技术指标**：用 `research_preset` 一键自动计算K线分析中常用的技术指标，并通过 `plot` 一键出图"
msgstr ""
"**Technical indicators**: Use `research_preset` to automatically calculate "
"technical indicators commonly used in K-line analysis with one click, and "
"use `plot` to draw charts with one click"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:42
msgid ""
"**横向对比**：用 `returns` 自动计算股票的多种收益率指标，并通过横向对比方法 `zscore` / `rank` 进行因子横向对比排名"
msgstr ""
"**Horizontal comparison**: Use `returns` to automatically calculate a "
"variety of stock return indicators, and use the horizontal comparison method"
" `zscore` / `rank` to perform horizontal comparison and ranking of factors"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:43
msgid ""
"**投资组合**：使用 `portfolio(..., benchmark=...)` 创建**研究向**的投资组合并粗略计算投资组合收益回报"
msgstr ""
"**PORTFOLIO**: Use `portfolio(..., benchmark=...)` to create a **research-"
"oriented** portfolio and roughly calculate the portfolio return"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:44
msgid ""
"**理解边界**：`HistoryPanel` 提供的投资组合 `portfolio` / 收益回报 `cum_return` "
"等工具不是真正的精确回测，**不含**交易成本、交割、MOQ计算"
msgstr ""
"**Understand the boundaries**: The investment portfolio `portfolio` / income"
" return `cum_return` and other tools provided by `HistoryPanel` are not "
"truly accurate backtests, and **do not include** transaction costs, "
"delivery, and MOQ calculations"

