"slicing, see [HistoryPanel Basic Operations](2.4-historypanel-basics.md); "
"the factors and combinations section below can be skipped as needed."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:92
msgid "下面我们可以开始正式地详细介绍 `HistoryPanel` 的基本功能："
msgstr ""
"Now we can start to formally introduce the basic functions of `HistoryPanel`"
" in detail:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:96
msgid "准备数据：获取一个 HistoryPanel"
msgstr "Prepare data: Get a HistoryPanel"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:98
msgid ""
"若您已读完 [HistoryPanel 数据面板基础操作](2.4-historypanel-basics.md)，对本节三维结构与 "
"`get_kline` 创建方式已熟悉，可直接跳到「时序变换与缺失处理」或「计算收益率与波动率因子」。"
msgstr ""
"If you have finished reading [HistoryPanel Basic Operations of Data Panel] "
"(2.4-historypanel-basics.md) and are familiar with the three-dimensional "
"structure of this section and the creation method of `get_kline`, you can "
"jump directly to \"Time Series Transformation and Missing Processing\" or "
"\"Calculating Yield and Volatility Factors\"."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:100
msgid ""
"当我们已经在数据源中下载了股票的价格数据以后，就可以通过 `qt.get_kline()` 或 `qt.get_history_data()` 获取 "
"`HistoryPanel`了。二者都只接受 **History** 形状；若要把沪深 300 收盘价当作**基准序列**（Reference），请用 "
"`qt.get_reference_data('close-000300.SH', "
"...)`，不要把它当成面板里多出来的一只「普通标的维」来理解（面板里当然也可以同时放入 `000300.SH` 做对比——那是 History "
"多标的，与 Reference 入口是两回事）。"
msgstr ""
"After we have downloaded the stock price data from the data source, we can "
"obtain `HistoryPanel` through `qt.get_kline()` or `qt.get_history_data()`. "
"Both only accept the **History** shape; if you want to use the CSI 300 "
"closing price as the **base sequence** (Reference), please use "
"`qt.get_reference_data('close-000300.SH', ...)`. Do not understand it as an "
"extra \"ordinary standard dimension\" in the panel (of course you can also "
"put `000300.SH` in the panel for comparison - it is a History multi-"
"standard, and it is two different things from the Reference entry)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:102
msgid "例如，下面的代码可以获取沪深300指数（`000300.SH`）和平安银行 (`000001.SZ`) 在2023年1月的全部日K线数据："
msgstr ""
"For example, the following code can obtain all daily K-line data of the CSI "
"300 Index (`000300.SH`) and Ping An Bank (`000001.SZ`) in January 2023:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:116
msgid ""
"`HistoryPanel` 的数据结构是一个三维的ndarray，它相当于多个结构相同的 `DataFrame` 堆叠起来，其中每一个 "
"`DataFrame` 包含一只股票/指数/基金的各种历史数据，而整个 `HistoryPanel` 则包含了所有股票/指数/基金的数据。"
msgstr ""
"The data structure of `HistoryPanel` is a three-dimensional ndarray, which "
"is equivalent to stacking multiple `DataFrame` with the same structure. Each"
" `DataFrame` contains various historical data of a stock/index/fund, while "
"the entire `HistoryPanel` contains the data of all stocks/indexes/funds."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:118
msgid "打印hp可以直观地看到它的数据结构:"
msgstr "Print hp to visually see its data structure:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:120
msgid ""
"它包含沪深300和平安银行两支股票，每支股票又包含一张数据表，每张表包含开盘/最高/最低/收盘/交易量等五列和二十多行数据（每个交易日一行）："
msgstr ""
"It contains two stocks, CSI 300 and Ping An Bank. Each stock contains a data"
" table. Each table contains five columns of "
"opening/highest/lowest/closing/trading volume and more than 20 rows of data "
"(one row for each trading day):"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:147
msgid "通过 `HistoryPanel` 的几个基本属性可以查看它包含的数据量和数据类型："
msgstr ""
"The amount and type of data it contains can be viewed through several basic "
"properties of `HistoryPanel`:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:149
msgid "**`hp.shape`** 一个 `(M, L, N)` 三元组，分别对应 **股票数 × 时间长度 × 数据类型数**；"
msgstr ""
"**`hp.shape`** A `(M, L, N)` triple, corresponding to **number of stocks × "
"length of time × number of data types**;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:150
msgid ""
"**`hp.shares`** 一个 `List`，`HistoryPanel` 中所有的股票/指数代码，例如 `['000300.SH', "
"'000001.SZ']`；"
msgstr ""
"**`hp.shares`** All stock/index codes in a `List`, `HistoryPanel`, such as "
"`['000300.SH', '000001.SZ']`;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:151
msgid ""
"**`hp.htypes`** 一个 `List`，`HistoryPanel` 中所有的数据类型名称，通常包含 `['open', 'high', "
"'low', 'close', 'vol']` 等。"
msgstr ""
"**`hp.htypes`** All data type names in a `List`, `HistoryPanel`, usually "
"including `['open', 'high', 'low', 'close', 'vol']` etc."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:165
msgid "时序变换与缺失处理（shift / diff / pct_change / dropna）"
msgstr ""
"Timing transformation and missing processing (shift/diff/pct_change/dropna)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:167
msgid "了解面板结构之后，研究里常见的下一步是：对任意列做时间位移、差分或百分比变化，并清理缺失——为后续因子列做准备。"
msgstr ""
"After understanding the panel structure, the common next step in research is"
" to perform time shifts, differences, or percentage changes on any column, "
"and clean up the missing elements—to prepare for subsequent factor columns."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:169
msgid ""
"**注**：本节只讲 `HistoryPanel` **内核** API。截面 IC、分位组合等见独立模块 "
"[`qteasy.research`](../api/research.rst)（[下方 cookbook](#截面-ic-"
"与分位组合qteasyresearch)）；正式回测仍见 [从 HistoryPanel 研究到 Strategy / "
"Operator](#从-historypanel-研究到-strategy--operator迁移路径)。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**: This section only talks about `HistoryPanel` **Kernel** API. For "
"cross-section IC, quantile combination, etc., see the independent module "
"[`qteasy.research`](../api/research.rst) ([cookbook below](#section-ic-and "
"quantile combination qteasyresearch)); for formal backtesting, see [from "
"HistoryPanel research to Strategy / Operator](#from-historypanel-research "
"to-strategy--operator migration path)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:171
msgid "**最小原理**："
msgstr "**Minimum Principle**:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:173
msgid ""
"`shift` / `diff` / `pct_change` 均沿 **hdates**（时间轴）作用，返回**新**面板；正 `periods` "
"表示向后看历史（与 pandas 一致）；`periods` 须为非零整数。"
msgstr ""
"`shift` / `diff` / `pct_change` all act along **hdates** (time axis) and "
"return to the **new** panel; positive `periods` means looking backwards in "
"history (consistent with pandas); `periods` must be a non-zero integer."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:174
msgid ""
"`pct_change` 是**任意列**的通用百分比变化，不调用 `_resolve_price_htype`；价格语义、复权根名解析请用下一节的 "
"`returns`。"
msgstr ""
"`pct_change` is the general percentage change of **any column** and does not"
" call `_resolve_price_htype`; please use `returns` in the next section for "
"price semantics and re-right root name analysis."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:175
msgid ""
"填充类（`fillna` / `ffill` / `fillinf`）默认**原地**；`bfill` 默认返回新对象。可变性总表见 "
"[HistoryPanel 基础操作 §8](2.4-historypanel-basics.md#8-副本语义与-inplace)。"
msgstr ""
"Filling classes (`fillna` / `ffill` / `fillinf`) default to **in place**; "
"`bfill` returns new objects by default. A general table of mutability can be"
" found in [HistoryPanel Basic Operations §8](2.4-historypanel-"
"basics.md#8-Copy Semantics and -inplace)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md:177
msgid "下面仍使用沪深 300 + 平安银行的日线面板（可用全年区间以便观察位移效果）："
msgstr ""
